{"id":"olvido","lemma":"olvido","pos":"noun","rank":2279,"glosses":["oblivion","forgetting, ending of memory","idea meaning an abstract place to put what is wanted to be forgotten, as in the collocation consign to oblivion"],"ipa":"/olˈbido/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"olvidos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-olvido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nunca olvido una cara.","en":"I never forget a face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/430390","words":[{"g":"never"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"face"}]},{"text":"Nunca olvido un nombre.","en":"I never forget a name.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/169267","words":[{"g":"never"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"name"}]},{"text":"No olvido a mis amigos.","en":"I don't forget my friends.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"}]},{"text":"Casi me olvido el paraguas en el tren.","en":"I almost left my umbrella in the train.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553701","words":[{"g":"almost"},{"g":"me"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"umbrella, brolly"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"train"}]},{"text":"Soy muy malo con los nombres, pero nunca olvido una cara.","en":"I'm really bad with names, but I never forget a face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610806","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"bad"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"name","l":"nombre"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"never"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"face"}]}]}